  "CII-FREXT-CR-490": ["Warning: cac:TaxExchangeRate may contain only SourceCurrencyCode, TargetCurrencyCode, CalculationRate and Date; remove other child elements.","Avviso: cac:TaxExchangeRate può contenere solo SourceCurrencyCode, TargetCurrencyCode, CalculationRate e Date; rimuovere gli altri elementi figlio."],
  "UBL-FREXT-CR-410": ["Warning: in cac:DeliveryTerms keep only cbc:ID and cac:DeliveryLocation/cbc:Name (Incoterms); remove any other child element.","Avviso: in cac:DeliveryTerms mantenere solo cbc:ID e cac:DeliveryLocation/cbc:Name (Incoterms); rimuovere ogni altro elemento figlio."],
  "UBL-FREXT-CR-645": ["Warning: in line-level cac:DeliveryTerms keep only cbc:ID and cac:DeliveryLocation/cbc:Name (Incoterms); remove any other child element.","Avviso: in cac:DeliveryTerms di riga mantenere solo cbc:ID e cac:DeliveryLocation/cbc:Name (Incoterms); rimuovere ogni altro elemento figlio."],
  "UBL-FREXT-SR-48": ["A line with subtype DETAIL or none must have exactly one cac:Item/cac:ClassifiedTaxCategory; other subtypes (e.g. GROUP) may have at most one.","Una riga con sottotipo DETAIL o assente deve avere esattamente un cac:Item/cac:ClassifiedTaxCategory; gli altri sottotipi (es. GROUP) al massimo uno."]
